! PLAYER~VOIDADJACENT

Sets adjacent-sector avoids for the current ship/session.

''Include:'' [[player.ts]]
''Defined at:'' `/include/player.ts:1353`

!! Source Excerpt
<pre>
#-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-
getsector $PLAYER~CURRENT_SECTOR $PLAYER~SECTORINFO
if ($PLAYER~SECTORINFO.WARP[1] = 0)
  send &quot;&#x27;This sector has no warps, maybe you need to scan it first*&quot;
  halt
else
  setvar $PLAYER~VOIDSECT 0
  :PLAYER~VOIDS
</pre>

